1|// Read-aloud controller: one dedicated audio element per reader mount,
2|// per-chapter manifests fetched lazily, duck signal for the music
3|// player. The element lives in the layout-level provider, so scrolling
4|// never interrupts playback. Play starts at the live scene (the scene
5|// under the reading line); pausing keeps the position, so pressing play
6|// again in the same scene resumes where it paused.
