1|// Read-sync: a requestAnimationFrame loop follows audio.currentTime
2|// through the manifest (surviving seek, pause, and rate changes because
3|// it never keeps its own clock) and maps words onto the whole
4|// paragraphs in the reading column. The spoken paragraph is brought in
5|// with followIntoView; within 4 s of a hand move the voice keeps
6|// reading but the mark hides instead of yanking the reader back.
7|"use client";
